B.hbB=new A.v(B.is,["\u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a","AI picks a random design style from a long list (Neobrutalist, Swiss, Editorial, Glassmorphism, Retro-futuristic, Bauhaus, Japandi, etc.) and creates a one-page landing page concept. Emphasis on feeling, atmosphere, and a single cohesive scrolling experience.","Optional: Product/Service hint. The AI will conceive or adapt the business concept to fit the chosen style.","**Role:** Expert Landing Page Creative Director.\n**Task:** Generate a ONE-PAGE LANDING PAGE design brief (for a single ultra-tall vertical visual, Aspect Ratio 1:8) using a RANDOMLY SELECTED design style. Use a random selection method\u2014do NOT default to Neobrutalist or any favorite. Actually randomize.\n\n**Available Design Styles (pick ONE at random, or choose another professional style not listed):**\n- Neobrutalist (raw, bold, confrontational) | Swiss/International (grid-based, ultra-clean) | Editorial (magazine-inspired, sophisticated) | Glassmorphism (translucent, blurred depth) | Retro-futuristic (80s future, refined nostalgia) | Bauhaus (geometric, primary shapes) | Art Deco (elegant patterns, luxury) | Minimal (extreme reduction, maximum whitespace) | Flat (solid colors, simple, clean) | Material (cards, subtle shadows, motion) | Neumorphic (soft shadows, tactile) | Monochromatic (single color, tonal depth) | Scandinavian (hygge, warm minimalism) | Japandi (zen meets hygge) | Dark Mode First (high contrast elegance) | Modernist (clean lines, timeless) | Organic/Fluid (flowing shapes, blob forms) | Corporate Professional (trust-building, refined) | Tech Forward (innovative, future-focused) | Luxury Minimal (premium restraint) | Neo-Geo (refined geometric, mathematical) | Kinetic (motion-driven, controlled) | Gradient Modern (sophisticated color transitions) | Typography First (type as hero) | Metropolitan (urban sophistication).\n\n**Output format \u2014 EXACTLY THREE PARAGRAPHS:**\n\n**Paragraph 1:** State the chosen style and conceive an innovative business/service concept for a SINGLE-PAGE landing page. Describe the core emotional qualities and mood visitors should experience. How should visual hierarchy and flow feel as they scroll? Include colorful elements as appropriate for emotional impact.\n\n**Paragraph 2:** Explain the design philosophy through emotion and UX. How should typography feel\u2014authoritative, welcoming, cutting-edge? What sensation should interactions and animations create\u2014smooth and liquid, snappy, gentle and organic? Describe how the single-page journey should emotionally progress from first impression to final CTA in one scrolling arc.\n\n**Paragraph 3:** Give abstract reference points: types of spaces, cultural movements, artistic periods, architectural styles, or design philosophies that embody this aesthetic. Reference the emotional qualities of premium experiences and refined craftsmanship. Explain how these references should influence the emotional quality and visual sophistication of the final one-page design, without naming specific brands.\n\n**Critical:** This is ONE COHESIVE LANDING PAGE, single scrolling experience. Focus on feeling, atmosphere, and abstract quality references. Keep references conceptual and high-level for maximum creative interpretation.","https://storage.feeef.net/u/cededgp9i6u5/ai/n5jwqengij97.jpg"],t.w)
B.hbv=new A.v(B.is,["E-commerce Style","Analyzes the uploaded product image and generates persuasive Arabic sales copy plus a ready-to-copy design prompt for the Nano Banana image generator. One output: a single code block with the full infographic prompt (9:32 aspect, hero \u2192 problem \u2192 solution \u2192 before/after \u2192 features \u2192 comparison \u2192 lifestyle \u2192 reviews \u2192 CTA).","Product image only. AI identifies product, features, audience, and color palette, then fills the template with Arabic copy and English visual descriptions.",'Analyze the uploaded product image. Identify the product, its key features, target audience, and best color palette. Act as a world-class Arabic Direct Response Copywriter and AI Prompt Engineer.\n\nYOUR MISSION: Write highly persuasive Arabic sales copy for this specific product, and output a READY-TO-COPY design prompt for the "Nano Banana" image generator.\n\nSTRICT RULES FOR YOUR OUTPUT:\n1. Output ONLY the final design prompt inside a single code block. NO conversational text.\n2. Fill all [bracketed placeholders] with your generated Arabic text and English visual descriptions based on the image.\n3. Remove all structural labels (like [HERO] or [PROBLEM]) in your output.\n\n--- USE THIS EXACT TEMPLATE TO FORMAT YOUR OUTPUT ---\n\nAct as a world-class Mobile E-commerce Designer. Generate an ultra-long vertical infographic landing page (aspect ratio 9:32 or longer) for the product in the uploaded image.\n\nCRITICAL TEXT RULES:\n1. ONLY render the exact Arabic text provided inside the quotation marks " ".\n2. ABSOLUTELY DO NOT render any English structural words or labels.\n3. Ensure all Arabic typography is massive and NEVER falls below 20px in size to guarantee strict mobile readability.\n\nAESTHETIC & FLOW INSTRUCTIONS:\nCreate one continuous journey. Use smooth color gradients (specifically [insert English colors matching the product image here]) and subtle kinetic lines. No hard dividing lines. Feature the product repeatedly.\n\n* Visual Flow: Dynamic background matching the [insert product vibe]. Product is floating.\n* Top Badge (Small Yellow Text): "[\u0627\u0643\u062a\u0628: \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0645\u0628\u064a\u0639\u0627\u064b \u0623\u0648 \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f]"\n* Main Headline (HUGE WHITE BOLD): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0631\u0626\u064a\u0633\u064a \u062c\u0630\u0627\u0628 \u0648\u0642\u0648\u064a \u062c\u062f\u0627\u064b \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Subhead (Large Text): "[\u062c\u0645\u0644\u0629 \u062a\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0627\u0626\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0628\u0631\u0649 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Smooth transition to a muted area with an icon showing a problem.\n* Headline (Large Bold Red): "[\u0633\u0624\u0627\u0644 \u064a\u0644\u0645\u0633 \u0645\u0634\u0643\u0644\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u064a\u0644 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Body Text (Medium Black): "[\u0627\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0643\u0644\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u062e\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0631]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Burst of bright light transitioning to a clean background. Product appears triumphantly.\n* Headline (HUGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u064a\u0642\u062f\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u0643\u062d\u0644 \u0646\u0647\u0627\u0626\u064a]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u062c\u0645\u0644\u0629 \u062a\u0624\u0643\u062f \u0642\u0648\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0644]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Split screen or side-by-side comparison layout. Left side is dark/dull showing [describe the problem state visually]. Right side is bright/vibrant showing [describe the transformed/happy state with the product].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u062c\u0630\u0627\u0628 \u0644\u0644\u0641\u0631\u0642 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0648\u0628\u0639\u062f \u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Before Text (Medium Red): "\u274c \u0642\u0628\u0644: [\u0648\u0635\u0641 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0627\u0646\u0627\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* After Text (Medium Green): "\u2705 \u0628\u0639\u062f: [\u0648\u0635\u0641 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0644\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0646\u062a\u064a\u062c\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Extreme close-up on [describe the most important feature].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644\u0649 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0642\u0648\u064a \u0644\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Close-up on [describe a second important feature].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Clean, modern comparison layout. Our product glowing and prominent vs a generic dull alternative.\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u064a\u0642\u0627\u0631\u0646 \u0648\u064a\u062b\u0628\u062a \u062a\u0641\u0648\u0642 \u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0646\u0627 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Our Product Feature 1 (Medium Green): "\u2714\ufe0f [\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u062d\u0635\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0646\u0627]"\n* Competitor Flaw 1 (Medium Red): "\u274c [\u0639\u064a\u0628 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u0631\u0649]"\n* Our Product Feature 2 (Medium Green): "\u2714\ufe0f [\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0642\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0646\u0627]"\n* Competitor Flaw 2 (Medium Red): "\u274c [\u0639\u064a\u0628 \u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u0631\u0649]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Lifestyle background showing [describe a scene where the product is used].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0639\u0646 \u0641\u0627\u0626\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u064a\u0648\u0645\u064a\u0627\u064b]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u0643\u064a\u0641 \u064a\u062d\u0633\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u062d\u064a\u0627\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0632\u0628\u0648\u0646]"\n\n* Visual Flow: 5 large glowing stars \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 centered.\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD BLACK): "\u062b\u0642\u0629 \u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0626\u0646\u0627"\n* Review Text (Medium Black): "[\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629 \u0625\u064a\u062c\u0627\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631\u0629 \u0628\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0646 \u0632\u0628\u0648\u0646 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Guarantee Text (Medium Green): "\u2705 \u0636\u0645\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0631\u062f\u0627\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0644"\n* Visual Flow: Solid, high-contrast footer section. Product prominent next to CTA button.\n* Urgency Text (Large White Bold): "\u26a0\ufe0f \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0645\u062d\u062f\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u062c\u062f\u0627\u064b\u060c \u0627\u0637\u0644\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646!"\n* CTA Button (HUGE BLACK TEXT on YELLOW Button): "\u0627\u0637\u0644\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646 - \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0641\u0639 \u0639\u0646\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645"',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/cededgp9i6u5/ai/landing-pages/blrbrcz20ps2.png"],t.w)
B.hbo=new A.v(B.is,["Ramadan Light (Spirituality & Day)","Peaceful, holy, and airy. Uses white marble, soft clouds, and matte gold. Perfect for prayer rugs, religious books, modest fashion (Abayas/Qamis), and home decor.","Product Name, Headline (Arabic), Spiritual Benefit, Material/Scent, Price, CTA",'**Role:** Islamic Art Director & 3D Artist.\n**Task:** Generate ONE ultra-tall vertical image (Aspect Ratio 1:8).\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udea8 USER INPUTS (FILL THESE):\n- **Headline (Arabic):** [INSERT RAMADAN HEADLINE HERE - e.g., \u0631\u0645\u0636\u0627\u0646 \u0643\u0631\u064a\u0645]\n- **Spiritual Benefit:** [INSERT BENEFIT HERE]\n- **Material/Scent:** [INSERT MATERIAL HERE]\n- **Price:** [INSERT PRICE HERE]\n- **CTA Button:** [INSERT BUTTON TEXT HERE]\n- **Product:** [INSERT PRODUCT NAME HERE]\n\n---\n### \ud83c\udf19 VISUAL ENGINE (CRITICAL):\n- **Aesthetic:** "Heavenly Peace." White Marble, Cream, Matte Gold, Soft Clouds.\n- **Lighting:** "Golden Hour" sunlight streaming through Islamic geometrical windows (Mashrabiya).\n- **The "Interlocking Flow":** Soft white clouds and flowing beige silk ribbons connect the zones vertically.\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udcdc THE 7-ZONE JOURNEY:\n1.  **Zone 1 ( The Minaret Hero):** The **[Product]** sits on a white marble archway. In the background, a faint silhouette of a mosque in the clouds. Title "**[Headline]**" in 3D Gold Calligraphy.\n2.  **Zone 2 (The Lantern/Fanous):** A beautiful gold lantern hangs down. Its soft light illuminates the texture of the product. Text: "Blessing & Quality".\n3.  **Zone 3 (Texture Zoom):** Extreme close-up of the fabric/material. A string of prayer beads (Sebha) winds through the scene. Text: "**[Material/Scent]**".\n4.  **Zone 4 (The Iftar Table):** A circular portal showing the product placed in a warm family setting (Dates and Milk nearby). Text: "**[Spiritual Benefit]**".\n5.  **Zone 5 (The Moon Phase):** A vertical timeline showing the moon phases (Crescent to Full). A special offer is tied to the "Full Moon".\n6.  **Zone 6 (The Gift):** The silk ribbon ties into a bow around the "**[Price]**" tag. Button: "**[CTA Button]**".\n7.  **Zone 7 (Ramadan Trust Footer):** Islamic Pattern Panel. Gold Icons:\n    - "\u062a\u0648\u0635\u064a\u0644 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u064a\u062f" (Fast Truck)\n    - "\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u0623\u0635\u0644\u064a" (Star)\n    - "\u062f\u0641\u0639 \u0639\u0646\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645" (Hand)\n\n**Output:** 512x2048, Soft Focus, Angelic, High Key Lighting.',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/i76kodivlrwg/ai/landing-pages/b8ylxz7vv5xh.jpg"],t.w)
B.hbx=new A.v(B.is,["\u0627\u0644\u062a\u062c\u0627\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0644\u0643\u062a\u0631\u0648\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0628\u0647\u062c\u0645\u0629","High-energy, 3D clay-like aesthetic with vibrant colors (Orange/Blue) and interlocking bubbles/confetti. Best for gadgets, toys, flash sales, and high-conversion impulse buys.","Product Name, Headline (Arabic), Main Feature, Price, CTA Button",'**Role:** Expert C-Commerce Visual Designer (Taobao Style).\n**Task:** Generate ONE ultra-tall vertical image (Aspect Ratio 1:8).\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udea8 USER INPUTS (FILL THESE):\n- **Headline (Arabic):** [INSERT HEADLINE HERE]\n- **Main Feature:** [INSERT FEATURE HERE]\n- **Price:** [INSERT PRICE HERE]\n- **CTA Button:** [INSERT BUTTON TEXT HERE]\n- **Product:** [INSERT PRODUCT NAME HERE]\n\n---\n### \ud83c\udfa8 VISUAL ENGINE (CRITICAL):\n- **Aesthetic:** "High-Fidelity 3D Pop." Use C4D (Cinema 4D) rendering. Soft, clay-like textures mixed with realistic product photos.\n- **Palette:** High Energy Orange & Blue.\n- **The "Interlocking Flow":** No straight lines. Use floating bubbles and 3D confetti to connect sections vertically.\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udcdc THE 6-ZONE JOURNEY:\n1.  **Zone 1 (The Festival):** The **[Product]** sits on a bouncy 3D podium. Fireworks effect. Massive inflated bubble text: "**[Headline]**".\n2.  **Zone 2 (Visual Demo - 30% Space):** A "Magnifying Glass" effect floats over the product. We see the internal battery/tech glowing.\n3.  **Zone 3 (Benefit Cards):** Three floating "Glassmorphism" cards stacked vertically. Inside are 3D icons visualizing **[Main Feature]**.\n4.  **Zone 4 (Social Proof):** A dense cloud of 3D "Love Hearts" and "Like Thumbs" swirling downwards.\n5.  **Zone 5 (The Coupon):** A jagged, ripped paper ticket graphic. Inside: "**[Price]**". Next to it, a massive pill-shaped button: "**[CTA Button]**".\n6.  **Zone 6 (Trust Footer):** A solid brand-color panel. White Icons + Text:\n    - "\u062a\u0648\u0635\u064a\u0644 58 \u0648\u0644\u0627\u064a\u0629" (Truck Icon)\n    - "\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0641\u0639 \u0639\u0646\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645" (Money Icon)\n    - "\u0636\u0645\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0648\u062f\u0629" (Shield Icon)\n\n**Output:** 512x2048, 3D Render, Octane, Highly Saturated.',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/i76kodivlrwg/ai/landing-pages/qbynf6c5yzxl.jpg"],t.w)
B.hbA=new A.v(B.is,["\u0627\u0644\u0630\u0651\u0647\u0628 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0636\u0629","Premium, fluid design using liquid gold and beige silk transitions. Ideal for high-end fashion, leather bags, jewelry, perfumes, and luxury accessories.","Product Name, Headline (Arabic), Material/Feature, Price, CTA Button",'**Role:** Tmall Luxury Visual Director.\n**Task:** Generate ONE ultra-tall vertical image (Aspect Ratio 1:8).\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udea8 USER INPUTS (FILL THESE):\n- **Headline (Arabic):** [INSERT HEADLINE HERE]\n- **Material/Feature:** [INSERT FEATURE HERE]\n- **Price:** [INSERT PRICE HERE]\n- **CTA Button:** [INSERT BUTTON TEXT HERE]\n- **Product:** [INSERT PRODUCT NAME HERE]\n\n---\n### \ud83c\udfa8 VISUAL ENGINE (CRITICAL):\n- **Aesthetic:** "Liquid Luxury." Realistic textures.\n- **Palette:** Gold, Beige, Cream. Warm Lighting.\n- **The "Interlocking Flow":** A continuous ribbon of liquid gold and beige silk flows seamlessly from top to bottom, guiding the eye.\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udcdc THE 6-ZONE JOURNEY:\n1.  **Zone 1 (The Monolith):** The **[Product]** sits on a marble island. Giant 3D Gold text wraps around it: "**[Headline]**".\n2.  **Zone 2 (Texture Zoom - 30% Space):** The silk ribbon loops into a circle, acting as a lens. Extreme close-up of the **[Product]** material. Text: "**[Material/Feature]**".\n3.  **Zone 3 (The Collection):** The silk flows down to form steps. The product appears in 3 different colors (Black, Brown, Beige) on these steps.\n4.  **Zone 4 (Elegant Detail):** A macro shot of the zipper/buckle glinting in the light.\n5.  **Zone 5 (The Offer):** The silk gathers into a pillow at the bottom. A shiny price tag reads "**[Price]**" next to a jewel-like button "**[CTA Button]**".\n6.  **Zone 6 (Trust Footer):** Dark Marble Panel. Gold Icons + Text:\n    - "\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0621" (Headset)\n    - "\u062a\u0648\u0635\u064a\u0644 \u0633\u0631\u064a\u0639" (Truck)\n    - "\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0631\u062c\u0627\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0644" (Money Bag)\n\n**Output:** 512x2048, Photorealistic, 8K, Cinematic Lighting.',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/i76kodivlrwg/ai/landing-pages/wgffp2tbbyoi.jpg"],t.w)
B.hby=new A.v(B.is,["\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0643\u0646\u0648\u0644\u0648\u062c\u064a\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0626\u064a\u0629","Cyber-utility style featuring neon lines, frosted glass, and exploded views to visualize technical specifications. Perfect for electronics, appliances, and tools.","Product Name, Headline (Arabic), Key Spec, Price, CTA Button",'**Role:** Product Viz Expert.\n**Task:** Generate ONE ultra-tall vertical image (Aspect Ratio 1:8).\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udea8 USER INPUTS (FILL THESE):\n- **Headline (Arabic):** [INSERT HEADLINE HERE]\n- **Key Spec:** [INSERT SPEC HERE]\n- **Price:** [INSERT PRICE HERE]\n- **CTA Button:** [INSERT BUTTON TEXT HERE]\n- **Product:** [INSERT PRODUCT NAME HERE]\n\n---\n### \ud83c\udfa8 VISUAL ENGINE (CRITICAL):\n- **Aesthetic:** "Cyber-Utility." Frosted glass, Neon lines, X-Ray views.\n- **Palette:** Dark Grey background, Neon Blue/Orange highlights.\n- **The "Interlocking Flow":** Glowing data cables and laser beams connect the zones vertically.\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udcdc THE 6-ZONE JOURNEY:\n1.  **Zone 1 (Zero Gravity):** The **[Product]** floats in the air. Neon HUD (Heads Up Display) text behind it: "**[Headline]**".\n2.  **Zone 2 (Exploded View - 40% Space):** The product parts separate slightly. We see the motor/inner tech. A glowing label points to it: "**[Key Spec]**".\n3.  **Zone 3 (Function Demo):** Visual representation of power (wind/heat/speed) flowing from the product downwards.\n4.  **Zone 4 (Comparison):** A split holographic screen. Left: Old Tech (Red X). Right: **[Product]** (Green Check).\n5.  **Zone 5 (The Hologram):** A projector base at the bottom beams the "**[Price]**" into the air next to a neon button "**[CTA Button]**".\n6.  **Zone 6 (Trust Footer):** Metal Grid Panel. Glowing Icons + Text:\n    - "\u0636\u0645\u0627\u0646 \u0644\u0645\u062f\u0629 \u0633\u0646\u0629" (Shield)\n    - "\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u0623\u0635\u0644\u064a" (Badge)\n    - "\u062f\u0641\u0639 \u0628\u0639\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062c\u0631\u064a\u0628" (Eye)\n\n**Output:** 512x2048, Unreal Engine 5 Style, High Contrast, Detailed.',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/i76kodivlrwg/ai/landing-pages/c7q8bhtour8h.jpg"],t.w)
