B.hbD=new A.v(B.is,["Eid Light (Joy & Celebration)","Playful, colorful, and energetic. Uses pastels, balloons, and confetti. Perfect for kids' clothes, toys, chocolates, and family outfits.","Product Name, Headline (Arabic), Joy Benefit, Fabric/Taste, Price, CTA",'**Role:** Eid Celebration Designer.\n**Task:** Generate ONE ultra-tall vertical image (Aspect Ratio 1:8).\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udea8 USER INPUTS (FILL THESE):\n- **Headline (Arabic):** [INSERT EID HEADLINE HERE - e.g., \u0639\u064a\u062f\u0643\u0645 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0631\u0643]\n- **Joy Benefit:** [INSERT BENEFIT HERE]\n- **Fabric/Taste:** [INSERT DETAIL HERE]\n- **Price:** [INSERT PRICE HERE]\n- **CTA Button:** [INSERT BUTTON TEXT HERE]\n- **Product:** [INSERT PRODUCT NAME HERE]\n\n---\n### \ud83c\udf88 VISUAL ENGINE (CRITICAL):\n- **Aesthetic:** "Morning Joy." Pastel Pink, Baby Blue, Mint Green, White.\n- **Elements:** Balloons, Bunting flags, Confetti, Wrapped Gifts.\n- **The "Interlocking Flow":** A long, winding ribbon and falling confetti connect the zones from top to bottom.\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udcdc THE 7-ZONE JOURNEY:\n1.  **Zone 1 (The Party Pop):** The **[Product]** bursts out of a striped gift box. Confetti everywhere. Title "**[Headline]**" in 3D Balloon letters.\n2.  **Zone 2 (The Outfit/Look):** (If clothes) A ghost mannequin effect showing the outfit. (If other) The product wearing a tiny party hat. Text: "Style & Fun".\n3.  **Zone 3 (The Sweets):** Traditional Eid sweets (Makrout/Baklava) float around the product to set the mood. Text: "**[Fabric/Taste]**".\n4.  **Zone 4 (The Family Moment):** A polaroid frame pinned to the ribbon showing a happy family/kid scene. Text: "**[Joy Benefit]**".\n5.  **Zone 5 (The Eidiya):** Floating paper money and coins (Eidiya concept) raining down.\n6.  **Zone 6 (The Big Tag):** A massive swinging price tag hanging from the ribbon shows "**[Price]**". Button: "**[CTA Button]**".\n7.  **Zone 7 (Eid Trust Footer):** Confetti Pattern Panel. Icons:\n    - "\u0647\u062f\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u064a\u062f" (Star)\n    - "\u062a\u0648\u0635\u064a\u0644 \u0633\u0631\u064a\u0639" (Rocket)\n    - "\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0628\u062f\u0627\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0642\u0627\u0633" (Refresh)\n\n**Output:** 512x2048, High Saturation, Pastel, Fun, Bright.',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/i76kodivlrwg/ai/landing-pages/globn0mmal8o.jpg"],t.w)
B.hbt=new A.v(B.is,["Eid Dark (Glamour & Fireworks)","Exciting, loud, and sparkly. Uses purple, gold, and fireworks. Best for evening wear, makeup, jewelry, and high-tech gadgets.","Product Name, Headline (Arabic), Glamour Spec, Shine/Sparkle, Price, CTA",'**Role:** Event & Stage Designer.\n**Task:** Generate ONE ultra-tall vertical image (Aspect Ratio 1:8).\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udea8 USER INPUTS (FILL THESE):\n- **Headline (Arabic):** [INSERT HEADLINE HERE - e.g., \u0647\u062f\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u064a\u062f]\n- **Glamour Spec:** [INSERT SPEC HERE]\n- **Shine/Sparkle:** [INSERT DETAIL HERE]\n- **Price:** [INSERT PRICE HERE]\n- **CTA Button:** [INSERT BUTTON TEXT HERE]\n- **Product:** [INSERT PRODUCT NAME HERE]\n\n---\n### \ud83c\udf86 VISUAL ENGINE (CRITICAL):\n- **Aesthetic:** "The Grand Finale." Royal Purple, Gold, Red, Sparkles.\n- **Lighting:** Stage spotlights and Fireworks reflections.\n- **The "Interlocking Flow":** Trails of light (long exposure light painting) and falling gold glitter connect the zones.\n\n---\n### \ud83d\udcdc THE 7-ZONE JOURNEY:\n1.  **Zone 1 (Center Stage):** The **[Product]** is on a podium with spotlights hitting it. Fireworks explode in the background. Title "**[Headline]**" in Marquee Lights.\n2.  **Zone 2 (The Sparkle):** Glitter/Sparkle effect overlay. The product rotates. Text: "**[Glamour Spec]**".\n3.  **Zone 3 (The Reflection):** The product sits on a mirrored floor reflecting the fireworks. Text: "**[Shine/Sparkle]**".\n4.  **Zone 4 (The Crowd):** Silhouettes of a cheering crowd or party atmosphere in the background (blurred). The product is the star.\n5.  **Zone 5 (The VIP Card):** A Gold "VIP Member" card floats, showing exclusive perks.\n6.  **Zone 6 (The Golden Ticket):** A Golden Ticket visual appears at the bottom with "**[Price]**". Button: "**[CTA Button]**".\n7.  **Zone 7 (Glamour Trust Footer):** Dark Purple Panel. Neon Icons:\n    - "\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0637\u0644\u0628\u0627\u064b" (Fire)\n    - "\u062c\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0639\u0627\u0644\u064a\u0629" (Diamond)\n    - "\u062a\u0648\u0635\u064a\u0644 VIP" (Crown)\n\n**Output:** 512x2048, Bokeh Effect, Shiny, Festive, Contrast.',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/i76kodivlrwg/ai/landing-pages/wi4s8klgtsw8.jpg"],t.w)
B.hbw=new A.v(B.is,["Smart Ecommerce","Analyzes the product image and picks one random design style (Neobrutalist, Swiss, Japandi, Glassmorphism, etc.); generates persuasive Arabic sales copy and a ready-to-copy Nano Banana infographic prompt where the aesthetic and flow follow the chosen style for a unique, style-driven landing page.","Product image only. AI identifies product and audience, randomly selects one design style, then fills the infographic template with Arabic copy and style-consistent visual descriptions.",'Analyze the uploaded product image. Identify the product, its key features, target audience, and best color palette. Act as a world-class Arabic Direct Response Copywriter and AI Prompt Engineer.\n\nSTEP 1 \u2014 RANDOM STYLE: Pick ONE design style at random. Use a random selection method\u2014do NOT default to a favorite. Actually randomize.\n\n**Available Design Styles (pick ONE at random):** Neobrutalist (raw, bold, confrontational) | Swiss/International (grid-based, ultra-clean) | Editorial (magazine-inspired, sophisticated) | Glassmorphism (translucent, blurred depth) | Retro-futuristic (80s future, refined nostalgia) | Bauhaus (geometric, primary shapes) | Art Deco (elegant patterns, luxury) | Minimal (extreme reduction, maximum whitespace) | Flat (solid colors, simple, clean) | Material (cards, subtle shadows, motion) | Neumorphic (soft shadows, tactile) | Monochromatic (single color, tonal depth) | Scandinavian (hygge, warm minimalism) | Japandi (zen meets hygge) | Dark Mode First (high contrast elegance) | Modernist (clean lines, timeless) | Organic/Fluid (flowing shapes, blob forms) | Corporate Professional (trust-building, refined) | Tech Forward (innovative, future-focused) | Luxury Minimal (premium restraint) | Neo-Geo (refined geometric, mathematical) | Kinetic (motion-driven, controlled) | Gradient Modern (sophisticated color transitions) | Typography First (type as hero) | Metropolitan (urban sophistication).\n\nSTEP 2 \u2014 YOUR MISSION: Write highly persuasive Arabic sales copy for this specific product, and output a READY-TO-COPY design prompt for the "Nano Banana" image generator. The entire infographic must embody the chosen style: its mood, typography feel, color approach, and visual flow (smooth/liquid, snappy, organic, etc.).\n\nSTRICT RULES FOR YOUR OUTPUT:\n1. Output ONLY the final design prompt inside a single code block. NO conversational text.\n2. Fill all [bracketed placeholders] with your generated Arabic text and English visual descriptions based on the image.\n3. Remove all structural labels (like [HERO] or [PROBLEM]) in your output.\n4. The aesthetic, gradients, and flow in your output MUST reflect the randomly chosen style\u2014not generic e-commerce. One cohesive scrolling experience in that style.\n\n--- USE THIS EXACT TEMPLATE TO FORMAT YOUR OUTPUT ---\n\nAct as a world-class Mobile E-commerce Designer. Generate an ultra-long vertical infographic landing page (aspect ratio 9:32 or longer) for the product in the uploaded image. The visual language MUST follow the [CHOSEN STYLE] aesthetic: [describe its key traits\u2014mood, shapes, typography feel, color strategy].\n\nCRITICAL TEXT RULES:\n1. ONLY render the exact Arabic text provided inside the quotation marks " ".\n2. ABSOLUTELY DO NOT render any English structural words or labels.\n3. Ensure all Arabic typography is massive and NEVER falls below 20px in size to guarantee strict mobile readability.\n\nAESTHETIC & FLOW INSTRUCTIONS:\nCreate one continuous journey in the [CHOSEN STYLE]. Use colors, gradients, and kinetic elements that match this style. No hard dividing lines. Feature the product repeatedly. Flow should feel [style-appropriate: e.g. smooth and liquid / snappy and bold / gentle and organic].\n\n* Visual Flow: [Style-appropriate] background matching the product vibe. Product is floating or staged per style.\n* Top Badge (Small Yellow Text): "[\u0627\u0643\u062a\u0628: \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0645\u0628\u064a\u0639\u0627\u064b \u0623\u0648 \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f]"\n* Main Headline (HUGE WHITE BOLD): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0631\u0626\u064a\u0633\u064a \u062c\u0630\u0627\u0628 \u0648\u0642\u0648\u064a \u062c\u062f\u0627\u064b \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Subhead (Large Text): "[\u062c\u0645\u0644\u0629 \u062a\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0627\u0626\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0628\u0631\u0649 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Smooth transition to a muted area with an icon showing a problem. [Style-consistent treatment].\n* Headline (Large Bold Red): "[\u0633\u0624\u0627\u0644 \u064a\u0644\u0645\u0633 \u0645\u0634\u0643\u0644\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0645\u064a\u0644 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Body Text (Medium Black): "[\u0627\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u0643\u0644\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u062e\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0631]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Burst of bright light transitioning to a clean background. Product appears triumphantly. [Style mood].\n* Headline (HUGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u064a\u0642\u062f\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u0643\u062d\u0644 \u0646\u0647\u0627\u0626\u064a]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u062c\u0645\u0644\u0629 \u062a\u0624\u0643\u062f \u0642\u0648\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0644]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Split screen or side-by-side comparison. Left: [problem state]. Right: [transformed state with product]. [Style-consistent layout].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u062c\u0630\u0627\u0628 \u0644\u0644\u0641\u0631\u0642 \u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0648\u0628\u0639\u062f \u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Before Text (Medium Red): "\u274c \u0642\u0628\u0644: [\u0648\u0635\u0641 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0627\u0646\u0627\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* After Text (Medium Green): "\u2705 \u0628\u0639\u062f: [\u0648\u0635\u0641 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0644\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0646\u062a\u064a\u062c\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Extreme close-up on [most important feature]. [Style-appropriate framing].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0648\u0644\u0649 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0642\u0648\u064a \u0644\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Close-up on [second important feature]. [Style-consistent].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u0634\u0631\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Clean comparison. Our product [style-appropriate: glowing/prominent] vs generic alternative. [Style layout].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u064a\u0642\u0627\u0631\u0646 \u0648\u064a\u062b\u0628\u062a \u062a\u0641\u0648\u0642 \u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0646\u0627 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Our Product Feature 1 (Medium Green): "\u2714\ufe0f [\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u062d\u0635\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0646\u0627]"\n* Competitor Flaw 1 (Medium Red): "\u274c [\u0639\u064a\u0628 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u0631\u0649]"\n* Our Product Feature 2 (Medium Green): "\u2714\ufe0f [\u0645\u064a\u0632\u0629 \u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0642\u0648\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0646\u0627]"\n* Competitor Flaw 2 (Medium Red): "\u274c [\u0639\u064a\u0628 \u062b\u0627\u0646\u064a \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062e\u0631\u0649]"\n\n* Visual Flow: Lifestyle background [scene where product is used]. [Style mood].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD COLORED TEXT): "[\u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 \u0639\u0646 \u0641\u0627\u0626\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u064a\u0648\u0645\u064a\u0627\u064b]"\n* Body Text (Large Black): "[\u0643\u064a\u0641 \u064a\u062d\u0633\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u062a\u062c \u062d\u064a\u0627\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0632\u0628\u0648\u0646]"\n\n* Visual Flow: 5 large glowing stars \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 centered. [Style-consistent].\n* Headline (LARGE BOLD BLACK): "\u062b\u0642\u0629 \u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0626\u0646\u0627"\n* Review Text (Medium Black): "[\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639\u0629 \u0625\u064a\u062c\u0627\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0642\u0635\u064a\u0631\u0629 \u0628\u0644\u0633\u0627\u0646 \u0632\u0628\u0648\u0646 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629]"\n* Guarantee Text (Medium Green): "\u2705 \u0636\u0645\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0631\u062f\u0627\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0644"\n* Visual Flow: Solid, high-contrast footer. Product prominent next to CTA. [Style finish].\n* Urgency Text (Large White Bold): "\u26a0\ufe0f \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0645\u062d\u062f\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u062c\u062f\u0627\u064b\u060c \u0627\u0637\u0644\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646!"\n* CTA Button (HUGE BLACK TEXT on YELLOW Button): "\u0627\u0637\u0644\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646 - \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0641\u0639 \u0639\u0646\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0645"',"https://storage.feeef.net/u/cededgp9i6u5/ai/landing-pages/sqwi4taxp3og.png"],t.w)
